        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the fun of grilling sanma on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill them to perfection, but be careful not to let them burn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill with skill and aim for a new high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Rules》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fan the flames and grill the sanma!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to cook both sides thoroughly, then pack the sanma up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to swap out the grill net and grate a supply of daikon radish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how many sanma you can cook before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《How to Play》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Place the sanma on the grill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Move the cursor and fan the flames!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. When one side is done, flip it over and grill the other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. When both sides are done, pack it up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Grill each part perfectly to earn more points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for a top spot on the global leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill quickly and precisely to earn the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in battles with up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grilling quickly and precisely is the key to victory!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the fun of grilling sanma on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill them to perfection, but be careful not to let them burn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill with skill and aim for a new high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Rules》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fan the flames and grill the sanma!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to cook both sides thoroughly, then pack the sanma up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to swap out the grill net and grate a supply of daikon radish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how many sanma you can cook before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《How to Play》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Place the sanma on the grill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Move the cursor and fan the flames!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. When one side is done, flip it over and grill the other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. When both sides are done, pack it up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Grill each part perfectly to earn more points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for a top spot on the global leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill quickly and precisely to earn the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in battles with up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grilling quickly and precisely is the key to victory!</p>",
